###
# --------------------
# Inventory Controller
# --------------------

### Get user inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get user inventory with category filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory?category=SEEDS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get inventory summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add item to inventory (Admin/System)
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/add
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "itemType": "SEED_RARE",
  "amount": 10
}

### Remove item from inventory
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/inventory/remove
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "itemType": "SEED_COMMON",
  "amount": 1
}

### Transfer item to another user
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "recipientId": "user-id-2",
  "itemType": "FRUIT",
  "amount": 1
}

### Check if user has enough of an item
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/check/SEED_COMMON/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

